# PSR-6c5 — Harbor durable proofs + recert inventory

## Intent

After PSR-6c3/6c4, Harbor has a **code path** for durable list/detail/register
when the API host is configured and `HARBOR_SMOKE_E2E_SEED` is off. PSR-6 gate
still requires **same-SHA evidence** and CERT rebind before `certified`.

This wave is **inventory + recipe only**:

- No `productionTier: certified`
- No proof-matrix Harbor rows restored
- No live Playwright / Postgres pack (Architect **YES** required)
- No `phase-*:gate` / `ci:integrity`

## Code truth vs gate truth (after 6c4)

| Gate criterion (PSR-6) | Code status | Live evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Default production path non-501 | Host configured → durable list/detail (empty/404 if no tours) | Unit covered; API boot path not live-proven here |
| Data survives restart | Booking + tour store are host Prisma/memory adapters | **Pending** Postgres restart drill |
| Tenant isolation | `runWithHttpRequestContext` + tour/booking RLS | **Pending** (pairs PSR-5i RLS family) |
| Duplicate registration | `HARBOR_REGISTRATION_DUPLICATE` + email/user checks | Unit covered; live pending |
| CERT-01…05 on release SHA | Tier still `stub`; matrix rows absent | **Pending** after live durable E2E |

## Important honesty gap

Default marketing Harbor smoke still sets `HARBOR_SMOKE_E2E_SEED=1`
(`smoke-marketing-harbor-e2e-servers.mjs`). That proves the **seed/memory** path.

**PSR-6c6b** landed a parallel durable harness
(`smoke-marketing-harbor-durable-e2e-servers.mjs` +
`test:smoke:harbor:durable`) — gap **G-SEED-E2E-HARNESS** closed as tooling.
Live Playwright on that harness still needs Architect **YES**.

## Proof families (Harbor-specific)

| Family | Purpose | Recipe (when YES) | Unit today |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **H-DEFAULT** | Seed off + host → non-501 catalog | API boot + `GET /harbor/catalog` with `x-tenant-id` | harbor HTTP durable test |
| **H-REGISTER** | Durable POST `/harbor/registrations` | Same + booking persistence | createHarborRegistration + HTTP test |
| **H-DUP** | Duplicate email → 409 | Two POSTs same email | unit duplicate test |
| **H-RESTART** | Registration survives process restart | Postgres + two API processes | pending |
| **H-RLS** | Cross-tenant catalog/register denied | Storage prisma + two tenants | pending (5i) |
| **H-CERT** | CERT-01…05 + promote | Guards + durable E2E + matrix + tier | recipe only |

## Recert checklist (do not execute in this wave)

1. Live durable catalog/register on tip SHA (seed **off**).
2. Record H-RESTART + H-RLS (+ optional pair with PSR-5i live pack).
3. Restore `plugins.harbor` CERT rows in proof matrix with durable CERT-03 hooks.
4. Set `guestConformance.productionTier: certified`.
5. `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry` + `pnpm run guard:workspace-certification`.
6. Architect YES on promote (OD-style).

## Residual deferred items

- HTTP idempotency wrapper on Harbor register (noted in 6c4)
- Seed fixture writer that inserts real tour rows for durable E2E
- PSR-5i live same-SHA pack (platform-wide)

## Smoke

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-6c5-harbor-durable-proofs-recert-smoke.mjs
```

## Next

After Architect **YES** on live packs: `PSR-6c6-harbor-live-evidence` then promote;
or start **PSR-7** while Harbor remains honest `stub` until live recert.
